+.. function:: qualname(obj)
+
+    .. versionadded:: 6.2
+
+    Returns the fully qualified dotted path of a class or function, suitable
+    for use with :func:`import_string`. Raises :exc:`TypeError` for other
+    objects. For example::
+
+        >>> from django.utils.module_loading import qualname
+        >>> from django.core.exceptions import ValidationError
+        >>> qualname(ValidationError)
